so I'm African, French and Spanish.

1357
02:05:19,237 --> 02:05:21,281
My mother's grandfather was Jewish.

1358
02:05:21,990 --> 02:05:25,286
Well, they mixed all that stuff up
in there real nice.

1359
02:05:25,328 --> 02:05:28,206
